strings.GRO_REICHSSTAAT_stabilisierung_des_reich:
The African continent is vast, filled with warlords, revolutionaries, separatist movements, degeneracy. It is the duty of every Kolonialverwalter to ensure the integrity of the Großafrikanischer Reichsstaat for the decades to come, and to allow the Statthalter to execute his plans. The stability of our nation is ever eroding, and will require neverending efforts. At least, as long as anyone in Afrika dares to defy the might of the Aryans.

